sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Telephony as Telephony / Vapi
    participant STT as Deepgram Nova-2
    participant LLM as GPT-4o
    participant API as Mock Tool API
    participant TTS as ElevenLabs / Cartesia

    Customer->>Telephony: Answers call
    Telephony->>STT: Audio stream
    STT-->>Telephony: Transcript
    Telephony->>LLM: State + transcript
    LLM-->>Telephony: Verification request
    Telephony->>TTS: Text
    TTS-->>Customer: Verify identity
    Customer->>Telephony: Verification code
    Telephony->>LLM: Transcript
    LLM->>API: verify_customer
    API-->>LLM: verified true/false
    alt Verified
        LLM-->>Telephony: Debt disclosure + negotiation
        Customer->>Telephony: PTP / hardship / dispute / paid
        LLM->>API: Resolution tool
        API-->>LLM: Result
        LLM->>API: mark_disposition
        API-->>LLM: Logged
    else Not verified
        LLM-->>Telephony: Safe failure response
    end
    Telephony->>TTS: Final response
    TTS-->>Customer: Goodbye
